<!-- Click Start above the timer or task. Its labels change as it runs. -->
[demo_focus] := countdown(25m)
- [ ] Try the editor controls :demo_controls @timer(demo_focus) @estimate(5m)
- [ ] Review the calculation @after(demo_controls) @due(tomorrow)

